正的飲食」；剛出鍋的熱騰騰白飯、搭配各類菜餚，自然而然地達到營養均衡；使用當季食材，感受不同時節的美味。\n\n一道道料理皆用心以對，充滿日本特有的細緻堅持，\n歡迎來到定食的世界，YAYOI 彌生軒。"],["https://www.google.com/local/place/rap/merchantdescription","https://support.google.com/legal/troubleshooter/1114905#ts\u003d1115658%2C1115689"]],null,null,"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-udEZWrh4r0M/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAAAA/6WJV87wPhgs/s44-p-k-no-ns-nd/photo.jpg",null,null,null,null,null,null,[[8,"餐廳"],"查看附近的餐廳"],[1],"臺北市北投區榮華里",null,null,null,null,[[["CgIgAQ\u003d\u003d","0ahUKEwiZ_eGUxNKWAxX-nq8BHaQhGXIQhbADCKADKAA","全部",[["CIHM0ogKEICAgICa256SVg",10,12,null,null,null,["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gps-cs-s/AHRPTWnG9fDR6p-zos0QA1Ng7WUN1pOxftLWlArEO92hZqmaD8aeG_WTuB-w987zt1wkpqj4FYcDV8n-BtSyYSkik7xIRzVpDbDnSbCI31V7fUk74KIKK040dFa_MB6ZIPPIwgmkjhix\u003dw529-h298-k-no","",[1478,832],[203,100]],null,[[3,121.52225139999999,25.1177242],[0,90],[1478,832],75],"N3iZatmFDf69vr0PpMPkkAc","0ahUKEwiZ_eGUxNKWAxX-nq8BHaQhGXIQzCcIoQMoAA",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,[10,"CIHM0ogKEICAgICa256SVg"],[10,3,[832,1478]],null,null,[[[2],[[null,null,25.1177242,121.52225139999999]]]],[1,null,null,[5,2],null,[null,null,"bizbuilder",[6,7,4,1,3]],null,null,[2018,3,19,13]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["UGCS_REFERENCE","CIHM0ogKEICAgICa256SVg||","1"]],1,null,null,null,null,null,null,["3765764142327235801","476420370312690203"],null,"yfeYlAZVvsU"]],null,null,null,null,null,null,0,1,null,0],["CgIgARICGAI\u003d","0ahUKEwiZ_eGUxNKWAxX-nq8BHaQhGXIQhbADCKIDKAE","最新",[["CIABIhByqit3NwokvRYE0l1_xRrv",10,12,null,null,null,["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gps-cs-s/AHRPTWmfPZb5PBskmd-tTlIupvVnvAKZR1ZsNpDQ3xKncMGU47kLjqTlvGaHvqon1yyhU0zq_yxcDV-wsk0JC8Wty9uiNA_Ul2HHcNk4mCCzwZbUohlVAuNQKpoVnlETI5whLOpSiGd5c_H8DxkO\u003dw397-h298-k-no","",[4032,3024],[203,100]],null,[[3,121.52225139999999,25.1177242],[0,90],[4032,3024],75],"N3iZatmFDf69vr0PpMPkkAc","0ahUKEwiZ_eGUxNKWAxX-nq8BHaQhGXIQzCcIowMoAA",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,nu