ced and smooth texture.\n👉 Not amazing, but a safe and reasonably priced option.\n比起上次在 yayoi 吃的牛肉壽喜燒定食，這次 $300 的親子丼套餐明顯更有CP值。\n整體表現中規中矩，豬排與蛋的融合度不錯，口感順、味道也算平衡。\n👉 不驚艷，但至少是比較不踩雷、價格也合理的一份選擇。",null,[0,185]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5761084837665729801/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPZGxaclJscGlTR1J3VG14d1ZsbFdaRk5pYTA1aFUycFNNR013UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5761084837665729801/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPZGxaclJscGlTR1J3VG14d1ZsbFdaRk5pYTA1aFUycFNNR013UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/5761084837665729801/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPZGxaclJscGlTR1J3VG14d1ZsbFdaRk5pYTA1aFUycFNNR013UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5761084837665729801/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPZGxaclJscGlTR1J3VG14d1ZsbFdaRk5pYTA1aFUycFNNR013UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5761084837665729801/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPZGxaclJscGlTR1J3VG14d1ZsbFdaRk5pYTA1aFUycFNNR013UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5761084837665729801/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPZGxaclJscGlTR1J3VG14d1ZsbFdaRk5pYTA1aFUycFNNR013UlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,2725,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOdlZrRlpiSGRwTmxwVllWZFNia05hU2pSMGMwRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x69c95cd783f7a1b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlNvVkFZbHdpNlpVYVdSbkNaSjR0c0E%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOdlZrRlpiSGRwTmxwVllWZFNia05hU2pSMGMwRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOdlZrRlpiSGRwTmxwVllWZFNia05hU2pSMGMwRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOdlZrRlpiSGRwTmxwVllWZFNia05hU2pSMGMwRRILMGRza0g5aVEyaW4aPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09sTnZWa0ZaYkhkcE5sc